        <div id="banner-trigger" class="nav_banner-trigger"></div><img src="/images/logoStripMobileMarketing1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1436px) 100vw, 1436px" srcset="/images/logoStripMobileMarketing1-p-500.avif 500w, /images/logoStripMobileMarketing1-p-800.avif 800w, /images/logoStripMobileMarketing1-p-1080.avif 1080w, /images/logoStripMobileMarketing1.avif 1436w" alt="" class="absolute-img-for-whom mobile"><img src="/images/logoStripDesktopMarketing1.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" srcset="/images/logoStripDesktopMarketing1-p-500.png 500w, /images/logoStripDesktopMarketing1-p-800.png 800w, /images/logoStripDesktopMarketing1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/logoStripDesktopMarketing1-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/logoStripDesktopMarketing1.avif 2560w" alt="" class="absolute-img-for-whom mobile-hide">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="gap-60-hero center for-whom-hero">
            <div class="left-hero max-w-510 center max-w-800">
              <div class="gap-4">
                <p class="text-caps">Marketing video production</p>
                <h1 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Transforming your marketing</span> with video that goes further <span class="span-pink-2"> </span></h1>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80">One campaign can need a launch video, paid ads, social cutdowns, event screens, and more. At Motion, we help marketing teams produce all of it without adding head count, losing brand consistency, or starting every asset from scratch.</div>
              <div class="wrap-btn">
