      <section class="section-insight for-whom">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 horizontal w-container">
          <div class="column-wrapper">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2 left center-sm">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">What we learned</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2">One great marketing video<span class="span-pink-2"> is rarely enough</span></h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-3 opacity-80">Every campaign now runs across more channels, formats, and audience touch points. The challenge is not simply producing a good video, but to keep enough fresh, on-brand content moving without putting more pressure on an already busy team.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-vflex list-wrap">
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---01.avif" alt="A purple circle with a play button on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">91% of businesses use video as part of their marketing. Simply having video is no longer enough. The difference comes from how consistently and effectively your team can use it.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---02.avif" alt="A purple button with a blue envelope on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">35% marketers say creative fatigue is becoming a growing problem. Even a strong campaign can start to lose attention when audiences keep seeing the same asset.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---03.avif" alt="A purple button with a speaker inside of it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">33% of marketers say a lack of time prevents them from producing more video, especially when every channel needs its own format, length, and message.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-2">
                <div class="card-content-why_choose-3 direction-horizontal padding-tight"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Key-Insight-Icon---04.avif" alt="A purple button with a shopping cart on it" class="img-why_choose">
                  <div class="text-14-150-3 opacity-80">The more content a campaign needs, the harder it becomes to maintain the same quality and brand consistency across every asset.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="column-wrapper hide-small"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67601fee10470581a90722d7/67602bd27d29b464069f8f7a_Key%20Insight.png" alt=""></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section-purpose for-whom">
        <div class="line-gradient-2"></div><img sizes="(max-width: 1439px) 100vw, 1152px" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478540_2Frame-1707478540.avif 500w, /images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif 2401w" alt="" src="/images/Frame-1707478540_2.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-purpose-3">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1408 w-container">
          <div class="slider-wrapper-4">
            <div class="top_side-slider-2">
              <div class="gap-4-purpose">
                <div class="text-12-caps-2 opacity-60">The Advantages</div>
                <div class="max-w-380-slider full">
                  <h2 class="h2"><span class="span-pink-2">How to get more</span><br>from every marketing video</h2>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="text-16-150-5 opacity-80">A strong video should not work in just one place. With the right approach, one campaign idea can support more channels, formats, and moments without your team starting from scratch each time.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-list-wrap-2">
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Icon-Marketing---01.avif" alt="A blue arrow on a white background" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Multiply</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Turn one campaign idea into launch videos, paid ads, social cutdowns, event content, and more.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Icon-Marketing---02.avif" alt="A blue arrow pointing to the right" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Adapt</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Reshape the story for different platforms, placements, formats, and audience attention spans.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Icon-Marketing---03.avif" alt="A white cloud with a purple bar on it" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Refresh</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Keep campaigns feeling current with new angles and variations instead of repeating the same creative.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="card-5">
                <div class="ai-essential-list-3">
                  <div class="w-layout-hflex hor-title"><img loading="lazy" src="/images/Icon-Marketing---04.avif" alt="A cloud with the word go on it" class="img-icn">
                    <h3 class="h4">Extend</h3>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-14-150-6 opacity-80">Keep your strongest ideas working beyond one launch, channel, or campaign.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
